    0.9.2.4-dev - 2026/05/12 (848b786f) [develop]
        :brief 完善模型 provider 管理、首页模型刷新和当前对话工作目录选择
        - feat(models): Paper 模型库存合并 OpenCode 内置 provider/model 候选，GitHub Copilot 等底座 provider 可进入 Paper allowlist 并作为主决策模型
        - feat(tui): /models 保存 allowlist、主决策模型或自定义 endpoint 后通知首页刷新，不再停留在未配置模型
        - feat(workspace): 新增 /folder（别名 /workspace、/cwd）选择当前对话工作目录，只影响当前 TUI 会话的新 PaperRun
        - fix(api): PaperRun 创建与 paper API 使用 PAPERCODE_HOME/PAPERCODE_TEST_HOME，避免读取错误的全局模型库存
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/model-inventory.ts - built-in provider candidates and persisted allowlist merge
            - packages/opencode/src/server/routes/instance/httpapi/handlers/paper.ts - provider candidate merge and Paper home propagation
            - packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/component/dialog-paper-model-roles.tsx - built-in model selection and refresh notification
            - packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/component/prompt/index.tsx - Paper model inventory footer refresh
            - packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/app.tsx - /folder command for conversation workspace
